@DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5072

# Local token (Development only): dotnet user-jwts create --claim "terminal=DKCPH SEGOT" --name gate-operator --output token
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@visitId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Liveness / readiness (anonymous)
GET {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

###
GET {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Create a visit (201 + Location header). Identifiers are normalised: "ab 12 345" -> "AB12345".
POST {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: sample-create-1

{
  "terminalId": "DKCPH",
  "truck": { "unitNumber": "tr 001", "licensePlate": "ab 12 345", "carrier": "ACME Haulage" },
  "driver": { "name": "Ada Lovelace", "licenseNumber": "dl 1234", "phone": "+4512345678" },
  "movements": [
    { "type": "Delivery",   "unitNumber": "cont 1", "location": "SEGOT", "reference": "BK-1" },
    { "type": "Collection", "unitNumber": "cont 2", "location": "NLRTM" }
  ]
}

### Create with a terminal the token does not grant -> 403
POST {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "terminalId": "NLRTM",
  "truck": { "unitNumber": "tr 001", "licensePlate": "ab 12 345" },
  "driver": { "name": "Ada", "licenseNumber": "dl 1" },
  "movements": [ { "type": "Delivery", "unitNumber": "cont 1", "location": "SEGOT" } ]
}

### Validation errors -> 400 with field-level "errors"
POST {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "terminalId": "DK",
  "truck": { "unitNumber": "", "licensePlate": "ab 12 345" },
  "driver": { "name": "", "licenseNumber": "x", "phone": "123" },
  "movements": []
}

### Get by id (404 for unknown ids and for visits of other terminals)
GET {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update status (strict forward flow: PreRegistered -> AtGate -> OnSite -> Completed; 409 otherwise)
POST {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "AtGate", "reason": "Arrived at gate 3" }

### Search: default = caller's terminals, last 30 days, page 1 of 20
GET {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search with filters (movementFrom/To: 2-letter country or 5-character UN/LOCODE; '+' in timestamps must be URL-encoded as %2B)
GET {{DFDS.SmartGate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits?terminalId=DKCPH&currentStatus=AtGate&movementFrom=SE&movementTo=NLRTM&createdTimeFrom=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&createdBy=gate-operator&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
